      "summary": "This module assembles authentication-related viewer mutations into a tRPC router. Authenticated procedures protect password changes, password verification, email resending, and account-password creation, while public procedures support unauthenticated verification-code validation and sending verification codes. Each endpoint validates input where required, dynamically imports its implementation, and forwards request context or selected context fields to the handler.",
